WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Sam is planning a dream trip.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.370
He wants to write, "I would
like to travel to Spain.

3
00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.750
" He looks for a Spanish
word for "would",

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.810
and he can't find one.

5
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:16.230
He knows quiero means "I want",
but that sounds less polite.

6
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.210
So how does Spanish say "would like"?

7
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.590
In this mission, you'll learn
the polite way to say what you'd

8
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.830
like to do, and the form of
the verb that follows it.

9
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.550
Then you'll give your opinion
with phrases like Creo que…

10
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.430
"I believe that…

11
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.390
" And you'll back it up with a reason,

12
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.970
using the word for "because": porque.

13
00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:41.130
Your mission: help Sam say "I
would like to travel to Spain".
